# SHA-256 of the prebuilt frameworks committed under addons/godot-iap/bin/
# and the Android archives committed under addons/godot-iap/android/.
# CI builds the frameworks in job `apple-frameworks` in ci-godot-iap.yml
# and uploads them as an artifact; the maintainer commits that artifact.
# `bun run audit:godot-binaries` verifies the committed files against this
# manifest — the release runs it as a deploy gate
# (release-godot.yml validate-ios) and CI re-runs it on main/next pushes and
# PRs to fail earlier. macOS digests pin pre-signing bytes: notarized
# releases re-sign those frameworks before zipping, so shipped macOS bytes
# differ by design.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional rebuild:
#   node scripts/audit-godot-binary-digests.mjs --write
868d9b7896917566c15b3e15da536dc53e1dbec35b0cd7a213c5be2b509e7b8e  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.debug.aar
edcfa32eb5e7f4ac1a172b0a48f679c01a6be109fb03b1ea454720f51971be2a  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.release.aar
2375b587f2f0e46509d61d735007f1a413542cc6f8477099e8312473a5992faa  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
38e8c325d8a515a3af7fff6154b87ec06fc19e19318175979325ab212fd351b0  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
df8cdd519e3ca18b50ac599c51b9c6a43c9276681a4307e52a741005133afc0c  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
a60e37c6bc68cc5a025751354afa6859658f4a1f325dd5e2162ef41f2f713e83  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
